00:05:41,533 --> 00:05:45,466
在重庆还有北京看病
zài Chóng Qìng hái yǒu Běi Jīng kàn bìng
See a doctor in Chongqing and Beijing

137
00:05:45,466 --> 00:05:47,100
都是大城市
dōu shì dà chéng shì
They are all big cities

138
00:05:47,633 --> 00:05:52,666
我不能说我看到的所有的医生都不好
wǒ bù néng shuō wǒ kàn dào de suǒ yǒu de yī shēng dōu bù hǎo
I can't say all the doctors I see are bad.

139
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:56,600
我最后看的是妇科
wǒ zuì hòu kàn de shì fù kē
The last one I saw was a gynecologist.

140
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:58,400
还有内分泌科
hái yǒu nèi fēn mì kē
Endocrinology

141
00:05:58,600 --> 00:06:02,800
因为女孩子你要定期的去检查嘛
yīn wèi nǚ hái zi nǐ yào dìng qī de qù jiǎn chá ma
Because girls, you need to have regular checkups.

142
00:06:02,900 --> 00:06:06,233
所以那个时候我也比较小
suǒ yǐ nà gè shí hou wǒ yě bǐ jiào xiǎo
So I was younger at that time.

143
00:06:06,266 --> 00:06:08,600
我不知道
wǒ bù zhī dào
I have no idea

144
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:12,033
可能说了什么东西让医生生气了
kě néng shuō le shén me dōng xī ràng yī shēng shēng qì le
Maybe I said something that made the doctor angry.

145
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:14,300
所以我就看病的时候
suǒ yǐ wǒ jiù kàn bìng de shí hou
So when I see a doctor

146
00:06:14,300 --> 00:06:17,900
这个医生就是对我发脾气了
zhè gè yī shēng jiù shì duì wǒ fā pí qì le
This doctor got mad at me.

147
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:23,000
还有就是医生说什么我不太懂
hái yǒu jiù shì yī shēng shuō shén me wǒ bú tài dǒng
I don't quite understand what the doctor said.

148
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:26,533
因为我没有看过那种东西
yīn wèi wǒ méi yǒu kàn guò nà zhǒng dōng xī
Because I haven't seen anything like that

149
00:06:26,633 --> 00:06:29,866
比如说一个检查我没有做过
bǐ rú shuō yí gè jiǎn chá wǒ méi yǒu zuò guò
For example, I haven't done a check.

150
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:32,333
医生说你拿着这个
yī shēng shuō nǐ ná zhe zhè gè
The doctor said you take this

151
00:06:32,333 --> 00:06:34,800
你去那个什么什么室
nǐ qù nà gè shén me shén me shì
You go to that room?

152
00:06:35,100 --> 00:06:37,200
我是有点听不懂的
wǒ shì yǒu diǎn tīng bù dǒng de
I don't quite understand

153
00:06:37,333 --> 00:06:40,333
所以我可能再问问题的时候
suǒ yǐ wǒ kě néng zài wèn wèn tí de shí hou
So I might ask questions again.

154
00:06:40,533 --> 00:06:43,833
这个医生就说你是不是脑子有问题
zhè gè yī shēng jiù shuō nǐ shì bú shì nǎo zi yǒu wèn tí
The doctor asked if there was something wrong with your brain.

155
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:47,300
所以我还被医生骂了
suǒ yǐ wǒ hái bèi yī shēng mà le
So I was scolded by the doctor.

156
00:06:47,666 --> 00:06:51,933
对小的时候跟妈妈在一起好一点
duì xiǎo de shí hou gēn mā ma zài yì qǐ hǎo yì diǎn
It's better to be with your mother when you are young.

157
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:54,133
因为妈妈会安排
yīn wèi mā ma huì ān pái
Because my mother will arrange it.

158
00:06:54,133 --> 00:06:56,100
我一个人去看病
wǒ yí gè rén qù kàn bìng
I go to the doctor alone

159
00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:58,933
就感觉没有非常好
jiù gǎn jué méi yǒu fēi cháng hǎo
I don't feel very good

160
