那我觉得你可能真的很倒霉
nà wǒ jué dé nǐ kě néng zhēn de hěn dǎo méi
I think you might be really unlucky.

161
00:07:03,433 --> 00:07:06,500
你遇到了一个脾气很不好的医生
nǐ yù dào le yí gè pí qì hěn bù hǎo de yī shēng
You met a doctor with a bad temper.

162
00:07:06,933 --> 00:07:11,200
因为我觉得在中国大部分的医生
yīn wèi wǒ jué dé zài zhōng guó dà bù fen de yī shēng
Because I think most doctors in China

163
00:07:11,266 --> 00:07:13,233
他们性格很好
tā men xìng gé hěn hǎo
They have good personalities

164
00:07:13,233 --> 00:07:14,800
脾气也很好
pí qì yě hěn hǎo
He also has a good temper.

165
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:20,100
可是因为在中国有很多人看医生
kě shì yīn wèi zài zhōng guó yǒu hěn duō rén kàn yī shēng
But because in China many people see doctors

166
00:07:20,300 --> 00:07:22,400
所以医生都很着急
suǒ yǐ yī shēng dōu hěn zháo jí
So the doctors are very anxious

167
00:07:22,633 --> 00:07:24,333
他跟你说话的时候
tā gēn nǐ shuō huà de shí hou
When he talks to you

168
00:07:24,333 --> 00:07:25,433
他说很快
tā shuō hěn kuài
He said soon

169
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:30,900
然后他没有很多的时间去安慰你
rán hòu tā méi yǒu hěn duō de shí jiān qù ān wèi nǐ
Then he doesn't have much time to comfort you.

170
00:07:30,900 --> 00:07:35,400
比如医生很少会说你不要担心
bǐ rú yī shēng hěn shǎo huì shuō nǐ bú yào dān xīn
For example, doctors rarely tell you not to worry.

171
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:36,333
没关系
méi guān xi
It doesn't matter

172
00:07:36,333 --> 00:07:39,466
你最近有没有做运动啊
nǐ zuì jìn yǒu méi yǒu zuò yùn dòng a
Have you done any exercise recently?

173
00:07:39,533 --> 00:07:41,533
你最近怎么样啊
nǐ zuì jìn zěn me yàng a
How are you doing lately?

174
00:07:41,533 --> 00:07:43,500
你今天心情怎么样啊
nǐ jīn tiān xīn qíng zěn me yàng a
How are you feeling today?

175
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:44,900
在中国的医生
zài zhōng guó de yī shēng
Doctors in China

176
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:47,866
很少很少会问你这样的问题
hěn shǎo hěn shǎo huì wèn nǐ zhè yàng de wèn tí
I rarely ask you questions like this.

177
00:07:48,300 --> 00:07:50,300
如果你去看医生
rú guǒ nǐ qù kàn yī shēng
If you see a doctor

178
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:51,666
医生说
yī shēng shuō
The doctor said

179
00:07:51,666 --> 00:07:53,300
蔚萱你可以进来了
Wèi Xuān nǐ kě yǐ jìn lái le
Weixuan, you can come in now.

180
00:07:53,466 --> 00:07:54,866
然后我进来以后
rán hòu wǒ jìn lái yǐ hòu
Then after I came in

181
00:07:54,866 --> 00:07:56,833
我坐下医生会说
wǒ zuò xià yī shēng huì shuō
I sit down and the doctor says

182
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:58,500
你哪不舒服啊
nǐ nǎ bù shū fu a
What's wrong with you?

183
00:07:58,533 --> 00:07:59,800
我说我头疼
wǒ shuō wǒ tóu téng
I said I had a headache

184
00:08:00,266 --> 00:08:01,833
他不会说
tā bú huì shuō
He won't say

185
00:08:01,833 --> 00:08:03,866
你头疼你什么感觉
nǐ tóu téng nǐ shén me gǎn jué
You have a headache, how do you feel?

186
00:08:03,933 --> 00:08:05,233
医生会问我
yī shēng huì wèn wǒ
The doctor will ask me

187
00:08:05,333 --> 00:08:06,533
你头疼几天了
nǐ tóu téng jǐ tiān le
You've had a headache for a few days

188
00:08:06,533 --> 00:08:08,266
你从什么时候开始头疼的
nǐ cóng shén me shí hou kāi shǐ tóu téng de
When did you start having headaches?

189
00:08:08,266 --> 00:08:09,266
好
hǎo
good

190
00:08:09,266 --> 00:08:10,600
然后他会记笔记
rán hòu tā huì jì bǐ jì
Then he would take notes

191
00:08:10,866 --> 00:08:14,066
对他会问非常客观的问题
duì tā huì wèn fēi cháng kè guān de wèn tí
He will ask very objective questions

192
00:08:14,233 --> 00:08:16,266
但是他不会安慰我
dàn shì tā bú huì ān wèi wǒ
But he won't comfort me.

193
00:08:16,266 --> 00:08:17,466
他不会说
tā bú huì shuō
He won't say

194
00:08:17,466 --> 00:08:18,666
你不要担心
nǐ bú yào dān xīn
Don't worry

195
00:08:18,733 --> 00:08:20,066
没关系的
méi guān xi de
It's okay

196
00:08:20,333 --> 00:08:21,333
不要担心
bú yào dān xīn
Don't worry

197
00:08:21,333 --> 00:08:23,433
对中国的医生不会这样
duì zhōng guó de yī shēng bú huì zhè yàng
This won't happen to Chinese doctors.

198
00:08:23,700 --> 00:08:28,100
中国的医生没有时间跟你说这些话
zhōng guó de yī shēng méi yǒu shí jiān gēn nǐ shuō zhè xiē huà
Chinese doctors don't have time to talk to you about this

199
00:08:28,300 --> 00:08:30,666
他们工作好辛苦
tā men gōng zuò hǎo xīn kǔ
They work so hard.

200
00:08:30,666 --> 00:08:32,433
要看很多病人
yào kàn hěn duō bìng rén
See a lot of patients

201
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:34,200
如果看不完
rú guǒ kàn bù wán
If you can't finish

202
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:36,833
我想病人也会抱怨
wǒ xiǎng bìng rén yě huì bào yuàn
I think patients will complain too.

203
00:08:36,833 --> 00:08:39,433
觉得怎么这样子
jué dé zěn me yàng zi
Why do you feel like this?

204
00:08:39,433 --> 00:08:40,266
我的时间
wǒ de shí jiān
My time

205
00:08:40,266 --> 00:08:41,866
可是他不来看我
kě shì tā bù lái kàn wǒ
But he doesn't come to see me

206
00:08:42,100 --> 00:08:43,200
人这么多
rén zhè me duō
There are so many people

207
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:45,200
要看这么多人
yào kàn zhè me duō rén
To see so many people

208
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:49,266
我觉得医生真的是好辛苦好辛苦
wǒ jué dé yī shēng zhēn de shì hǎo xīn kǔ hǎo xīn kǔ
I think doctors really work very hard.

209
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:51,933
我看了一个研究
wǒ kàn le yí gè yán jiū
I read a study

210
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:54,600
他说中国的医生
tā shuō zhōng guó de yī shēng
He said Chinese doctors

211
00:08:54,933 --> 00:09:00,233
差不多一天要看60到80个病人
chà bù duō yì tiān yào kàn liù shí dào bā shí gè bìng rén
I see about 60 to 80 patients a day.

212
00:09:00,900 --> 00:09:03,600
尤其是儿科医生
yóu qí shì ér kē yī shēng
Especially pediatricians

213
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:05,966
就是给小朋友看病的医生
jiù shì gěi xiǎo péng yǒu kàn bìng de yī shēng
A doctor who treats children.

214
00:09:05,966 --> 00:09:07,300
是最忙的
shì zuì máng de
is the busiest

215
00:09:07,433 --> 00:09:10,133
他们最忙的时候会看100个
tā men zuì máng de shí hou huì kàn yì bǎi gè
When they are busiest, they will watch 100

216
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,300
100个病人
yì bǎi gè bìng rén
100 patients

217
00:09:11,300 --> 00:09:12,466
一天
yì tiān
one day

218
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:14,266
很厉害对很牛
hěn lì hài duì hěn niú
Very powerful, very cool

219
00:09:14,266 --> 00:09:15,100
所以很忙
suǒ yǐ hěn máng
So busy

220
00:09:15,100 --> 00:09:15,733
对对对
duì duì duì
Yes, yes, yes

221
00:09:15,733 --> 00:09:19,033
我希望中国的医生可以赚更多的钱
wǒ xī wàng zhōng guó de yī shēng kě yǐ zhuàn gèng duō de qián
I hope Chinese doctors can make more money

222
00:09:19,300 --> 00:09:22,466
因为这个工作好辛苦
yīn wèi zhè gè gōng zuò hǎo xīn kǔ
Because this job is hard

223
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:26,866
可是我知道中国的医生没有赚很多钱
kě shì wǒ zhī dào zhōng guó de yī shēng méi yǒu zhuàn hěn duō qián
But I know Chinese doctors don't make a lot of money

224
00:09:27,466 --> 00:09:30,733
在西班牙看病的话
zài Xī Bān Yá kàn bìng de huà
See a doctor in Spain

225
00:09:31,033 --> 00:09:33,533
我觉得医生非常好
wǒ jué dé yī shēng fēi cháng hǎo
I think the doctor is very good

226
00:09:33,900 --> 00:09:37,300
我自己看过的医生都很好
wǒ zì jǐ kàn guò de yī shēng dōu hěn hǎo
The doctors I've seen are all very good.

227
00:09:37,533 --> 00:09:40,000
他们很关心我
tā men hěn guān xīn wǒ
They care about me

228
