对我态度很好
duì wǒ tài dù hěn hǎo
Very nice to me

229
00:09:42,066 --> 00:09:43,500
他们不会说
tā men bú huì shuō
They won't say

230
00:09:43,533 --> 00:09:45,066
你怎么样啊
nǐ zěn me yàng a
How are you?

231
00:09:45,066 --> 00:09:46,466
我也怎么样
wǒ yě zěn me yàng
What about me?

232
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:48,366
没有说跟你很...
méi yǒu shuō gēn nǐ hěn ...
I didn't say I was very...

233
00:09:48,366 --> 00:09:51,000
像朋友跟你很亲近
xiàng péng you gēn nǐ hěn qīn jìn
Like a friend who is very close to you

234
00:09:51,333 --> 00:09:54,733
可是他们很镇定
kě shì tā men hěn zhèn dìng
But they are calm

235
00:09:54,866 --> 00:09:56,466
他们很放松
tā men hěn fàng sōng
They are relaxed

236
00:09:56,700 --> 00:09:59,500
他们会给你解释一些东西
tā men huì gěi nǐ jiě shì yì xiē dōng xī
They'll explain things to you.

237
00:09:59,666 --> 00:10:01,133
如果你有问题
rú guǒ nǐ yǒu wèn tí
If you have questions

238
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:03,933
医生也不会觉得你怎么这么烦
yī shēng yě bú huì jué dé nǐ zěn me zhè me fán
The doctor won't think you're annoying.

239
00:10:04,233 --> 00:10:05,533
有这么多问题
yǒu zhè me duō wèn tí
There are so many problems

240
00:10:06,233 --> 00:10:11,200
我以前还在西班牙的医院当翻译
wǒ yǐ qián hái zài Xī Bān Yá de yī yuàn dāng fān yì
I used to work as a translator in a Spanish hospital.

241
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,900
那个是我的工作
nà gè shì wǒ de gōng zuò
That's my job.

242
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:16,100
那个时候我在儿科
nà gè shí hou wǒ zài ér kē
At that time I was in pediatrics.

243
00:10:16,233 --> 00:10:17,866
还有妇科
hái yǒu fù kē
And gynecology

244
00:10:18,133 --> 00:10:19,866
对那里的医生
duì nà lǐ de yī shēng
To the doctors there

245
00:10:19,866 --> 00:10:21,666
尤其是对小孩子
yóu qí shì duì xiǎo hái zi
Especially for children

246
00:10:21,933 --> 00:10:24,200
他们的态度非常好
tā men de tài dù fēi cháng hǎo
Their attitude is very good

247
00:10:24,500 --> 00:10:29,233
还有就是因为西班牙更国际化
hái yǒu jiù shì yīn wèi Xī Bān Yá gèng guó jì huà
Also, Spain is more international.

248
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:33,033
所以有时候面对的病人是外国人
suǒ yǐ yǒu shí hou miàn duì de bìng rén shì wài guó rén
So sometimes the patients we face are foreigners

249
00:10:33,266 --> 00:10:37,133
那可能会有语言上的这个冲突
nà kě néng huì yǒu yǔ yán shàng de zhè gè chōng tū
There might be a language conflict.

250
00:10:37,300 --> 00:10:40,100
还有一些文化上的冲突
hái yǒu yì xiē wén huà shàng de chōng tū
There are also some cultural conflicts

251
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:43,466
那医生也很有耐心
nà yī shēng yě hěn yǒu nài xīn
The doctor is also very patient.

252
00:10:43,866 --> 00:10:45,666
所以我觉得这个很好
suǒ yǐ wǒ jué dé zhè gè hěn hǎo
So I think this is good.

253
00:10:45,900 --> 00:10:48,133
我觉得和以前比起来
wǒ jué dé hé yǐ qián bǐ qǐ lái
I think compared to before

254
00:10:48,133 --> 00:10:50,233
中国现在的医生
zhōng guó xiàn zài de yī shēng
Doctors in China today

255
00:10:50,466 --> 00:10:52,600
他们的态度已经很好了
tā men de tài dù yǐ jīng hěn hǎo le
Their attitude is already very good.

256
00:10:52,833 --> 00:10:55,633
虽然他们还是很忙
suī rán tā men hái shì hěn máng
Although they are still busy

257
00:10:55,866 --> 00:11:00,333
但是他们会比较温柔的和病人说话
dàn shì tā men huì bǐ jiào wēn róu de hé bìng rén shuō huà
But they will speak to the patients more gently.

258
00:11:00,666 --> 00:11:01,233
太好了
tài hǎo le
Very good

259
00:11:01,233 --> 00:11:04,700
因为大部分来看病的人
yīn wèi dà bù fen lái kàn bìng de rén
Because most of the people who come to see the doctor

260
00:11:04,833 --> 00:11:06,500
他们都会担心
tā men dōu huì dān xīn
They will all worry

261
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:10,933
我是不是得了很严重的病
wǒ shì bú shì dé le hěn yán zhòng de bìng
